      "ALICE: One, two, three, four...\nALICE: RAMBOON NA BOO YEAH!/I, I GOTTA NEW LIFE, YOU WOULD HARDLY RECOGNIZE ME, I’M SO GLAD...\nGAIL: So just how did the Bellas make it to the finals?",
