      "BECA: Great. So instead of getting real world experience in what I actually want to do with my life, I’ll spend four years studying on the grass.\nKIMMY JIN: I’m going to the Activities Fair.\nBECA: Well then so am I. I’m going to go with my super-good friend, Kimmy Jin.",
      "AUBREY: I will stop at nothing to take down those dicklicks. [ALT: suck butts]\nCHLOE: Hey, Barb! Gonna audition this year? We have openings.\nBARB: Oh, now that you’ve puked your way to the bottom, you might actually consider me? I’ve auditioned three times and never got in because you s…\nBARB: The word’s out. The Bellas’s are the laughing stock of a cappella. Good look recruiting this year, douche-b’s.",
      "AUBREY: You call yourself Fat Amy?\nFAT AMY: Yep. So you twig bitches don’t do it behind my back.\nAUBREY: See you at auditions... Fat Amy.\nAUBREY: That was oddly satisfying."
    ]
